# Scattered into Shadow (jeuno 61), the start and the pools: Brutus in Upper Jeuno, Feiyin's three Underground Pools
# (UNDERGROUND_POOL_OFFSET + 0..2) and Dabotz's Ghost. A level 50 beastmaster with Wings of Gold completed: Brutus's 141
# (option 0: Prog 1), 143 (option 0: nothing; option 1: begun, Aquaflora 1-3 by addKeyItem, YOU_ARE_GIVEN_THREE_SPRIGS;
# Prog stays 1), Brutus with the sprigs held (142, an Event: the lookup cycles it with Path of the Beastmaster's
# completed Event 20, 20 first by container order, and takes turns with his script, whose 134 plays as Wings of Gold is
# completed), Osker at Prog 1 (nil: Path of the Beastmaster's 45), a bone chip traded to Brutus while available (no
# trade handler, his script has none). The pools: offset 0 with Aquaflora 2 (20: the sprig taken, Stage bit 1) and
# without it (nil: the pool's empty script); offset 2 with Aquaflora 1 (21: Stage bit 0) and without it (nil); offset 1
# at Prog 1 with Aquaflora 3: Dabotz's Ghost popped (claimed), noAction; again with the ghost up: popFromQM false, nil;
# the ghost's death with Aquaflora 3: Prog 2; offset 1 at Prog 2: 18 (Aquaflora 3 taken, Prog 3, Stage bit 2: Stage 7);
# offset 1 at Prog 3, no sprig: nil. Brutus at Prog 3: 144 (a Progress event: it wins at once; Prog 4); Osker at Prog 4:
# 145; Brutus at Prog 4: 149 (an Event, cycled and taking turns as 142).
lists UpperJeuno/Brutus/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Osker/onTrigger Feiyin/Underground_Pool/onTrigger Feiyin/Dabotzs_Ghost/onMobDeath UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/141 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/143 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/144 Feiyin/onEventFinish/20 Feiyin/onEventFinish/21 Feiyin/onEventFinish/18
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-55.5,8.2,97.5 job=BST lvl=50
quest Jeuno.ChocoboOnTheLoose completed
quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds completed
quest Jeuno.SaveMySon completed
quest Jeuno.PathOfTheBeastmaster completed
quest Jeuno.WingsOfGold completed
item BoneChip
login
trigger Brutus                              # available, Prog 0: 141 (long)
finish option=0                             # not 1: Prog 1
trade Brutus BoneChip x1                    # available: no trade handler, nil (his script has none)
trigger Brutus                              # Prog 1: 143 (short)
finish option=0                             # not 1: nothing
trigger Brutus                              # 143
finish option=1                             # begun: Aquaflora 1, 2, 3, YOU_ARE_GIVEN_THREE_SPRIGS
trigger Brutus                              # accepted, sprigs held: the lookup's turn: Path of the Beastmaster's 20
finish
trigger Brutus                              # his script's turn: 134
finish
trigger Brutus                              # the lookup's turn: the next Event, 142
finish
trigger Brutus                              # his script's turn: 134
finish
trigger Osker                               # Prog 1: nil; Path of the Beastmaster's 45 (replaceDefault)
finish-if-event
warp 11.5,0,250 Feiyin
trigger Underground_Pool                    # offset 0, Aquaflora 2: 20
finish                                      # Aquaflora 2 deleted, Stage bit 1
trigger Underground_Pool                    # offset 0, no Aquaflora 2: nil; the pool's empty script: nothing
trigger Underground_Pool+2                  # offset 2, Aquaflora 1: 21
finish                                      # Aquaflora 1 deleted, Stage bit 0
trigger Underground_Pool+2                  # offset 2, no Aquaflora 1: nil
trigger Underground_Pool+1                  # offset 1, Prog 1, Aquaflora 3: Dabotz's Ghost popped (claimed); noAction
trigger Underground_Pool+1                  # the ghost up: popFromQM false: nil
kill DABOTZS_GHOST                          # its death with Aquaflora 3 held: Prog 2
trigger Underground_Pool+1                  # Prog 2: 18
finish                                      # Aquaflora 3 deleted, Prog 3, Stage bit 2 (Stage 7)
trigger Underground_Pool+1                  # Prog 3, no Aquaflora 3: nil
warp -55.5,8.2,97.5 UpperJeuno
trigger Brutus                              # no sprigs, Prog 3: 144 (Progress)
finish                                      # Prog 4
trigger Osker                               # Prog 4: 145
finish
trigger Brutus                              # Prog 4: the lookup's turn: Path of the Beastmaster's 20
finish
trigger Brutus                              # his script's turn: 134
finish
trigger Brutus                              # the lookup's turn: 149
finish
trigger Brutus                              # his script's turn: 134
finish
